      "created_at": "2018-05-25T05:36:44Z",
      "updated_at": "2018-05-25T05:36:44Z",
      "body": "@myriamboure, hello 👋 \r\n\r\nFirst thing I would say is I'm not the best point of reference for questioning functionality designed for email confirm. Firstly because it's been a VERY long time since I wrote all this up, and secondly because you guys know the system much better than I do 😁 \r\n\r\nSo I think go with what @mkllnk and @oeoeaio have confirmed with you. \r\n\r\nThe only question I have is about the impact of this on the customer list for the enterprise - will the same email address show up twice, and thus be duplicated if the enterprise emails their customers? And even if this does happen, does it matter? And can enterprises even email their entire customer list?",
