      "created_at": "2018-05-26T17:30:26Z",
      "updated_at": "2018-05-26T17:30:26Z",
      "body": "So it looks like the final decision is to not associate old guest orders with newly registered customers. The minor outstanding issue is that there will be duplicate entries in an enterprise's customer list for the registered and non-registered orders for the same email address. \r\n\r\nA simple solution to that might be just to add a `guest` label in the UI next to the guest record, so it's clear to enterprise users why the email address is in there twice?",
